@host = https://localhost:7186

### 1. Login as Admin
POST {{host}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "usernameOrEmail": "admin",
  "password": "Password123!"
}

> {%
  client.global.set("admin_token", response.body.token);
%}

### 2. Login as HR Manager
POST {{host}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "usernameOrEmail": "hrmanager",
  "password": "Password123!"
}

> {%
  client.global.set("hr_token", response.body.token);
%}

### 3. Login as Viewer
POST {{host}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "usernameOrEmail": "viewer",
  "password": "Password123!"
}

> {%
  client.global.set("viewer_token", response.body.token);
%}

### 4. Register a New User
POST {{host}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "sarah",
  "email": "sarah@company.com",
  "password": "Password123!",
  "role": "HR_Manager"
}

### 5. Get Paginated Employees (Page 1, 10 items by default)
GET {{host}}/api/employees
Authorization: Bearer {{viewer_token}}

### 5.1 Get Paginated Employees (Page 2, 5 items per page)
GET {{host}}/api/employees?page=2&pageSize=5
Authorization: Bearer {{viewer_token}}

### 6. Create Employee (HR_Manager allowed, Viewer forbidden 403)
POST {{host}}/api/employees
Authorization: Bearer {{hr_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "John",
  "lastName": "Doe",
  "email": "john.doe@company.com",
  "department": "Engineering",
  "salary": 85000
}

### 7. Delete Employee (Admin ONLY, HR_Manager forbidden 403)
DELETE {{host}}/api/employees/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_token}}

### 8. Upload Employee Photo (multipart/form-data)
POST {{host}}/api/employees/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000/photo
Authorization: Bearer {{hr_token}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=boundary

--boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="avatar.png"
Content-Type: image/png

< ./avatar.png
--boundary--

### 9. Delete Employee Photo
DELETE {{host}}/api/employees/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000/photo
Authorization: Bearer {{hr_token}}

### 10. Health Check - Liveness Probe (Kubernetes livenessProbe)
GET {{host}}/health/live

### 11. Health Check - Readiness Probe (Kubernetes readinessProbe & Load Balancer)
GET {{host}}/health/ready

### 12. Health Check - Detailed System Diagnostics (Full JSON)
GET {{host}}/health
